dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi, ms. lee, how are you?
[patient] hi, doctor. i'm doing okay. i've been having a lot of back pain.
[doctor] okay. so, tell me a little bit more about what happened.
[patient] sure. so i was at a birthday party over the weekend, and i was running up the stairs and i ran into the railing and twisted my back.
[doctor] okay. and did you feel any pain in your legs?
[patient] no, not really.
[doctor] okay. and does the pain go away if you lie flat?
[patient] no, it's always there.
[doctor] and what about twisting motions, do those make it worse?
[patient] yes, they do.
[doctor] okay. and are you taking any pain medication?
[patient] yes, i'm taking ibuprofen.
[doctor] okay. have you had any back problems before?
[patient] no, this is the first time.
[doctor] okay. and have you had any surgeries before?
[patient] yes, i had a lumbar fusion.
[doctor] okay. and are you currently taking any other medications?
[patient] no, just the ibuprofen.
[doctor] okay. so, let's go ahead and do a quick exam of your back. i'm just going to press on some areas. does that hurt?
[patient] yes, it hurts.
[doctor] okay. and does it hurt when i do this? (straight leg raise) no?
[patient] no.
[doctor] okay. and does it hurt when i press on these areas? (examining for sensation) no?
[patient] no.
[doctor] okay. let's go ahead and get some x-rays of your back. we'll see if there's any fractures. those are going to show up on the x-rays. and i'm also going to order some x-rays to check the position of your hardware from your previous surgery. and it looks like your x-rays show that there's no obvious signs of an acute fracture. and there's evidence of a prior lumbar fusion with the hardware in good position. so, based on your exam and your x-rays, it sounds like you've got a lumbar spine strain. i think we can manage this with some ice and heat. i'd like you to continue taking motrin 800 mg 3 times a day with food. and follow up with me as needed. does that sound okay?
[patient] yes, that sounds good.
[doctor] okay. do you have any other questions for me?
[patient] no, i think that's it.
[doctor] okay. great. i'll see you next time.
[patient] thank you. }}<|eot_id|>
