dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hey, so i'm just going to go ahead and review your vitals. so your blood pressure is 130 over 80, your heart rate is 78, and your oxygen saturation is 98 percent on room air. i'm going to go ahead and review your history now. so you're here today for some joint pain. so you have a history of carpel tunnel release, you have chronic back pain, and depression. so tell me a little bit about your back pain. how has that been?
