dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi, how are you doing today?
[patient] i'm doing alright, i've been having some back pain.
[doctor] okay, let's talk a little bit about that. so you said you've been having some back pain. when did this start?
[patient] it started about two weeks ago.
[doctor] okay. and how would you describe the pain?
[patient] it's been in my back, it's been really sore.
[doctor] okay. and have you had any other symptoms like numbness or tingling in your feet?
[patient] no, i have not.
[doctor] okay. and have you noticed anything that makes the pain better or worse?
[patient] well, when i move around, it seems to get a little better, but when i sit or lay down, it gets worse.
[doctor] okay. have you had any trauma to your back recently?
[patient] no, nothing like that.
[doctor] okay. all right. so, have you taken any medication for the pain?
[patient] i've been taking ibuprofen.
