[patient] i've been taking 200 milligrams twice a day.
[doctor] okay. and how long have you been taking it?
[patient] for about a week now.
[doctor] okay. and has the pain been constant or does it come and go?
[patient] it's been pretty constant.
[doctor] okay. and do you have any other medical conditions?
[patient] i have diabetes.
