[patient] yes, i'm taking metformin twice a day.
[doctor] okay. all right. and do you have any family history of back problems?
[patient] no, i don't think so.
[doctor] okay. and what do you do for a living?
[patient] my family and i run a bakery.
[doctor] okay. okay. and do you do a lot of heavy lifting or bending at work?
