[patient] four times a day.
[doctor] okay. and how long have you been having these symptoms?
[patient] about two and a half weeks.
[doctor] okay. and have you noticed any numbness or tingling in your foot?
[patient] yes, i do have numbness and tingling in my foot.
[doctor] okay. is that new?
[patient] yes, it's been going on for a while.
[doctor] okay. have you ever had any other injuries to your knee?
[patient] no, i've had problems with my ankle. i've broken my second toe three times in the last ten years.
[doctor] okay. and do you do anything for exercise?
